/target

# The cargo-fuzz crate (fuzz/): its build output, the crash inputs libFuzzer writes and the coverage output. A
# finding is committed by hand under fuzz/regressions/.
/fuzz/target
/fuzz/artifacts
/fuzz/coverage
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store

# The book's generated reference pages: built, not committed. `cargo xtask docs-gen` writes them from the committed
# contract files (command and result schemas, rule catalogue, keymap sheet, glossary, CLI, query and api_v1 snapshots,
# format schemas, release notes); a test of xtask keeps this block equal to the generated directories and pages of
# docs_gen.rs.
/docs/book/src/reference/commands/
/docs/book/src/reference/rules/
/docs/book/src/reference/cli/
/docs/book/src/reference/format/
/docs/book/src/reference/release-notes/
/docs/book/src/reference/glossary.md
/docs/book/src/reference/keymaps.md
/docs/book/src/reference/queries.md
/docs/book/src/reference/api-v1.md

# Claude Code agent worktrees (local only)
.claude/worktrees/

# DeepSeek coder runs: task texts, dsh event logs and run state (local only)
.claude/deepseek/runs/
